---
description: Backend implementation conventions
globs: "backend/**/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Pydantic and pytest conventions already established in the repository.

Keep routes thin.
Put business logic in services/domain code.
Put persistence in repositories.
Put live DB, Catalog Package and LLM integrations behind adapters.

Use explicit typed request/response models.
Do not return ORM entities directly from APIs.

Add focused pytest coverage for behavior changes.
